{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.finalizeJoinPoint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">finalizeJoinPoint</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">jp</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint\">JoinPoint</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">jumps</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Jump\">Jump</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Assign `?H` of `jp` the equations of the parameters that all its `jumps` agree on, above the\ntrie of the jumps, `False` if no jump reaches `jp`, and each jump's `?pf` its proof. `vcgen`\nprocesses the RHS goal of `jp` after all goals below the registration, so every jump is known by\nthen.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.finalizeJoinPoint","kind":"def","line":277,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.finalizeJoinPoint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.lean#L277-L304"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.wpJump?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">wpJump?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">scope</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Scope\">Scope</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">info</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/WPApp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.WPApp\">WPApp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Close the goal `⊤ ⊑ wp⟦jp args⟧ post eposts ss` of a jump to a join point of `scope` with\n`__do_jp_spec args ss ?pf`, where `finalizeJoinPoint` assigns `?pf : ?H args ss`. A jump with a\nprecondition other than `⊤` unfolds `jp` instead.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.wpJump?","kind":"def","line":142,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.wpJump?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.lean#L142-L160"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.registerJoinPoint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">registerJoinPoint</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">scope</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Scope\">Scope</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">jp</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">val</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">info</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/WPApp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.WPApp\">WPApp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Scope\">Scope</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span>))</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Register the join point `jp := val` that `wpLet?` introduced into the goal\n`goal : pre ⊑ wp⟦…⟧ post eposts ss` over the states `ss`. Returns `scope` with `jp`, `goal` with\n`__do_jp_spec : ∀ xs ss, ?H xs ss → ⊤ ⊑ wp⟦jp xs⟧ post eposts ss`, and the goal\n`∀ xs ss, ?H xs ss → ⊤ ⊑ wp⟦val xs⟧ post eposts ss` for the join RHS `val`. Returns `none` if\n`jp` is no `__do_jp` with a lambda RHS under `+jp`, or if the states have no base lattice\ninstance.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.registerJoinPoint","kind":"def","line":89,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.registerJoinPoint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/JoinPoint.lean#L89-L140"}}],"imports":["Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context","Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Reduce","Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Util","Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.WPApp","Lean.Meta.Sym.AbstractS","Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr","Lean.Meta.Sym.InferType","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateMVarsS","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateS","Lean.Meta.Sym.Intro","Lean.Meta.Sym.MaxFVar"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint"}